      "updated": 1785746743751,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Commits of the types feat! (or BREAKING CHANGE),\nfeat, fix, docs, and refactor trigger the release\nworkflow.\n\nfeat! - major upgrade X.y.z\nfeat - minor upgrade x.Y.z\nfix, docs, and refactor - patch upgrade x.y.Z\n\nDuring execution, the workflow creates and pushes a\ncommit `chore(release): <version>`, which contains\nupdated `CHANGELOG.md` and `pyproject.toml` (or\nother files requiring changes for the release).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Commits of the types feat! (or BREAKING CHANGE), feat, fix, docs, and refactor trigger the release workflow.\n\nfeat! - major upgrade X.y.z\nfeat - minor upgrade x.Y.z\nfix, docs, and refactor - patch upgrade x.y.Z\n\nDuring execution, the workflow creates and pushes a commit `chore(release): <version>`, which contains updated `CHANGELOG.md` and `pyproject.toml` (or other files requiring changes for the release).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
