      "text": "Subsequent commits of the same or lower priority increment\nonly the pre-release number (N), without changing x.y.z.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Subsequent commits of the same or lower priority increment only the pre-release number (N), without changing x.y.z.",
